EN:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Happy birthday, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Today's your birthday, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}And this year is even more special{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Your true birthday only comes once
every 4 years, and we finally get to
celebrate it today!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Heh heh heh.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Aren't you excited?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
I have a surprise for you, {{TAG:0003:0025:}}so look in
your mailbox later!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Feliz cumpleaños, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hoy es tu cumple, ¿no?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Además, este año es muy especial{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Solo puedes celebrar tu cumple
el 29 de febrero cada año bisiesto,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡y eso solo ocurre cada cuatro años!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ya,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} eso lo sabe todo el mundo.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
En fin,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} te he dejado una sorpresilla
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}en tu buzón. ¡Échale un ojo luego!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Feliz cumpleaños, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oggi è il tuo cumpleaños, giusto?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}E quest'anno è ancora più speciale{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Puoi festeggiare il tuo cumpleaños
esattamente il 29 febbraio solo una
volta ogni quattro anni! Che storia!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Eh eh eh,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} pensi che stia esagerando?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Ad ogni modo,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} guarda nella cassetta
delle lettere,{{TAG:0003:0025:}} troverai una sorpresa!

{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Mmmh,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} avrei giurato che ci fosse
qualcosa di importante da
festeggiare oggi, ma al momento{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Eh eh eh,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} ma dai, sto scherzando!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Lo so benissimo che oggi
è il tuo cumpleaños!

